{"content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap\");\n.arcadia-sourcing{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;direction:ltr;}\n.hero-sourcing{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d0d0d,#1a1a1a,#001a1a);color:#fff;padding:80px 20px;text-align:center;}\n.hero-sourcing h1{font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#c9a84c;margin-bottom:16px;}\n.hero-sourcing p{font-size:1.1rem;color:#ddd;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 30px;}\n.btn-wa{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#25D366;color:#fff;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:50px;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;margin-top:20px;}\n.section{padding:60px 20px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;}\n.section-title{font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px;}\n.section-title span{color:#c9a84c;}\n.products-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px;}\n.product-card{background:#fff;border:2px solid #f0e6cc;border-radius:14px;padding:24px 18px;text-align:center;}\n.product-card h3{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;}\n.product-card p{color:#666;font-size:.9rem;}\n.price-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.95rem;}\n.price-table th{background:#c9a84c;color:#fff;padding:12px;text-align:center;}\n.price-table td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0e6cc;text-align:center;}\n.price-table tr:nth-child(even){background:#fdf8ee;}\n.faq{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;}\n.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid #f0e6cc;padding:16px 0;}\n.faq-q{font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;}\n.faq-a{color:#555;line-height:1.7;}\n.cta-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a1a,#001a1a);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;}\n.cta-box h2{color:#c9a84c;font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px;}\n.cta-box p{color:#ddd;margin-bottom:24px;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"arcadia-sourcing\">\n<div class=\"hero-sourcing\">\n<h1>👗 Import Clothing & Accessories from China</h1>\n<p>High-quality goods from the largest Chinese wholesale markets — Yiwu, Guangzhou, Shanghai — at unbeatable prices.</p>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20inquire%20about%20importing%20clothing%20and%20accessories%20from%20China\" class=\"btn-wa\" target=\"_blank\">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a><span class=\"arc-local-office-phone\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:15px;\">China office phone: <span dir=\"ltr\">+86 189 2316 6757</span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">What We <span>Source</span></h2>\n<div class=\"products-grid\">\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>👔 Men's Clothing</h3><p>T-shirts, shirts, trousers, jackets in bulk</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>👗 Women's Clothing</h3><p>Dresses, abayas, blouses, modern skirts</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>👶 Children's Clothing</h3><p>Newborn and kids clothing up to age 12</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>👜 Bags & Handbags</h3><p>Handbags, travel bags, backpacks in all sizes</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>💍 Jewelry & Accessories</h3><p>Watches, silver and gold-plated accessories</p></div>\n<div class=\"product-card\"><h3>👟 Shoes & Sandals</h3><p>Sports, formal, and casual footwear for men and women</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Approximate <span>Prices</span></h2>\n<table class=\"price-table\">\n<tr><th>Product</th><th>Min. Quantity</th><th>Approx. Price</th><th>Notes</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Basic T-Shirts</td><td>100 pcs</td><td>$1.5–$4/pc</td><td>100% Cotton</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Women's Handbags</td><td>50 pcs</td><td>$5–$18/pc</td><td>PU Leather</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Classic Watches</td><td>50 pcs</td><td>$8–$25/pc</td><td>Quality dependent</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sports Shoes</td><td>60 pairs</td><td>$6–$15/pair</td><td>Mixed sizes</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span></h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">Can we order goods with a private label?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">Yes, most suppliers accept custom logo printing from quantities of 200 pieces and above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">Is Chinese merchandise high quality?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">We carefully select suppliers and inspect goods before shipping. Quality depends on budget — we have options for every price range.</div></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\">Do you offer dropshipping services?</div><div class=\"faq-a\">Yes, we offer buying-on-behalf and reshipping services for those working in e-commerce.</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cta-box\">\n<h2>Launch Your Business Now 👗</h2>\n<p>Message us with the product, quantity, and budget and we will find you the best option</p>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/77064007561?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20inquire%20about%20importing%20clothing%20and%20accessories%20from%20China\" class=\"btn-wa\" target=\"_blank\">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "_elementor_data": ""}